<html lang="en"><head><title>How to fix Cloudflare error 1020 Access denied</title></head>
<body><article><h1>Error 1020: Access denied</h1>
<p>If you see "Sorry, you have been blocked" or "You are unable to access" a site, the owner used Cloudflare to restrict access.</p>
<p>The owner of this website has banned your country or region. Cloudflare Ray ID: example. Content not available in your country is a different problem.</p></article></body></html>
